api/graphic-design/
-------------------

A hand port of `src/core/graphic-design/` from napkin-sketch, taken at commit
d43caac191b2dfd532b3311f4ca1ea6969bb002f. Each module in that directory names
the upstream file it came from and the commit it was taken at, so the two can
still be diffed. The permission notice those headers are shorthand for is
reproduced here in full, per the MIT licence's own condition that it travel
with all copies or substantial portions of the software.

Source: https://github.com/isocialPractice/napkin-sketch


ai-helper/graphic-designer/
---------------------------

A hand port of the AI helper of the same name from napkin-sketch, taken at the
same commit: two skills, a command, a contract file and four scripts. The four
scripts name the upstream file they came from and record what changed on the
way in, which is a path in every case. The installer and the plugin manifest
were not ported.

Source: https://github.com/isocialPractice/napkin-sketch

